    "displayName": "Missing Mining Team",
    "titleSource": "localized_clean",
    "titleConfidence": "high",
    "briefing": "*********** People's Alliance ***********\n******/ 'Stronger When United' /******\n\nRE: Missing Mining Team\n\nWORK BRIEF: \nOne of our local crews set off for a dig and haven’t checked back in. With everything going on out there, people are starting to get a little worried, so we’d like someone to try and get eyes on them.\n\nI hate to say this, but if something happened to them, could you please identify everyone you find so we can let next of kin know?\n\nPAYMENT:\nStandard listed rate upon entire crew's status confirmation.\n\nAUTHORIZATION:\nBattaglia, Recco",
